WEBVTT

00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:05.080
This ten-question formative test is separate from ungraded practice The

00:00:05.080 --> 00:00:09.465
pass mark is eighty percent You have three total submissions

00:00:09.465 --> 00:00:13.445
per question and two total quiz attempts There are no

00:00:13.445 --> 00:00:18.820
penalties or partial marks After a failed first quiz complete

00:00:18.820 --> 00:00:23.490
relevant teaching review and practice before the one permitted retry

00:00:23.490 --> 00:00:26.340
Answer keys are withheld until the quiz has reached its

00:00:26.340 --> 00:00:31.095
final outcome This browser test is not an authenticated grade

00:00:31.095 --> 00:00:33.465
or a final examination
